WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.301
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:03.770
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:04.904
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.273
Former New Jersey
Governor Chris Christie

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:10.176
announced yesterday that he is
ending his presidential campaign

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.245
less than a week
before the Iowa caucuses.

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:15.715
That means last place
is now up for grabs!

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.850
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.586
The judge overseeing
his civil fraud trial today

00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:22.088
allowed former President Trump

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:24.924
to speak for five minutes
after his legal team

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.425
finished
their closing arguments,

00:00:26.425 --> 00:00:29.829
and now he's facing
11 more counts of fraud.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:32.365
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:33.966
Before he allowed
former President Trump

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:36.269
to address the court today,
Judge Arthur Engoron asked,

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:39.872
"Do you promise to just comment
on the facts and the law?"

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:41.974
Good luck.
That's like asking Jake,

00:00:41.974 --> 00:00:45.144
"Do you promise you won't
talk about State Farm?"

00:00:45.144 --> 00:00:47.180
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.348
During a Fox News
town hall last night,

00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:50.683
former President Trump
took credit

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.452
for overturning
Roe versus Wade.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:55.154
'Cause, look, if he's got
to keep his kids,

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:56.422
so do you.

00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:59.359
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:03.229
[ Laughter, cheering ]

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.430
[ Laughter, cheering stop ]

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.498
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:06.832
In last night's town hall,

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:08.601
former President Trump
repeated his claim

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:10.069
that Florida Governor
Ron DeSantis

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:12.104
would be working
in a pizzeria

00:01:12.104 --> 00:01:14.607
or a law firm
without his support.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:18.078
And the fact that he thinks
those two jobs are similar

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:20.647
explains a lot
about his legal team.

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:22.481
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:24.417
[ As Trump ] "I found this guy.
He was at a pizza place.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:27.286
Now he's my lawyer."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:29.822
Trump also said he knows who
he wants to be his running mate,

00:01:29.822 --> 00:01:31.691
but added,
"I can't tell you that."

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:32.792
Well, of course not.

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:34.427
You'd be putting
their life in danger.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:36.629
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:39.031
House speaker Mike Johnson said
during an interview yesterday

00:01:39.031 --> 00:01:41.233
that he's planning on calling
former President Trump

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:44.870
to walk him through his spending
deal with Senate Democrats.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:46.172
God, what are you
going to do next?

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:49.075
Walk a pigeon through algebra?

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:51.144
Guess which one's
going to take less time.

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:52.812
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:55.348
An F train derailed yesterday
in Brooklyn,

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:58.718
causing several hours
of normal F train service.

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:02.254
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.254 --> 00:02:04.257
It was the same,
but with a reason.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:06.592
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.592 --> 00:02:09.862
The technology company Augmental
unveiled a new device this week

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:11.163
called MouthPad,

00:02:11.163 --> 00:02:13.799
which allows users to scroll
through their smartphones

00:02:13.799 --> 00:02:15.134
by using their tongue.

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:18.137
Finally, a way to get
all the germs on my phone

00:02:18.137 --> 00:02:19.439
directly into my body.

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:20.873
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.873 --> 00:02:22.742
And finally,
the Coast Guard announced

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.076
that it recently seized

00:02:24.076 --> 00:02:27.080
nearly 2,500 pounds of cocaine
in the Caribbean Sea.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.282
The Coast Guard got suspicious
when they realized

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:31.951
all the fish [chuckles]
were flying fish.

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:33.920
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

